{
  "_comment_": [
    "Portable GitHub ruleset payload for the `main` branch.",
    "Mirrors terraform/github/branch-protection.tf for teams that prefer to apply",
    "the policy via `gh api` without running Terraform. See",
    "docs/github-branch-protection.md for the full policy specification.",
    "",
    "Apply with:",
    "  jq 'del(._comment)' .github/rulesets/main-protection.json | \\",
    "    gh api -X POST repos/groupsmix/affilite-mix/rulesets --input -",
    "",
    "Bypass actors are intentionally an empty list \u2014 admin / maintainer",
    "bypass is disabled. The Terraform module exposes a",
    "`break_glass_team_slug` variable for teams that want to grant",
    "PR-mode bypass to a documented incident-response team. To match",
    "that here, append a bypass_actors entry of shape:",
    "  { \"actor_id\": <team-id>, \"actor_type\": \"Team\", \"bypass_mode\": \"pull_request\" }"
  ],
  "name": "main-protection",
  "target": "branch",
  "enforcement": "active",
  "bypass_actors": [],
  "conditions": {
    "ref_name": {
      "include": [
        "refs/heads/main"
      ],
      "exclude": []
    }
  },
  "rules": [
    {
      "type": "deletion"
    },
    {
      "type": "non_fast_forward"
    },
    {
      "type": "required_linear_history"
    },
    {
      "type": "required_signatures"
    },
    {
      "type": "pull_request",
      "parameters": {
        "required_approving_review_count": 2,
        "dismiss_stale_reviews_on_push": true,
        "require_code_owner_review": true,
        "require_last_push_approval": true,
        "required_review_thread_resolution": true
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "required_status_checks",
      "parameters": {
        "strict_required_status_checks_policy": true,
        "required_status_checks": [
          {
            "context": "check"
          },
          {
            "context": "Required checks"
          },
          {
            "context": "RLS audit (E-6)"
          },
          {
            "context": "DB type drift (E-5)"
          },
          {
            "context": "Terraform validate"
          },
          {
            "context": "Dependency review"
          },
          {
            "context": "Secret leak prevention"
          },
          {
            "context": "License compliance"
          },
          {
            "context": "npm audit (high / critical)"
          },
          {
            "context": "Preview E2E gate"
          },
          {
            "context": "secret-scan"
          },
          {
            "context": "codeql"
          },
          {
            "context": "dependency-review"
          },
          {
            "context": "ci / build"
          },
          {
            "context": "security / semgrep"
          },
          {
            "context": "Accessibility (axe-core)"
          },
          {
            "context": "WCAG 2.2 AA"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}